Description: Scientific Tools for Python (gnu15 + openmpi5, OpenHPC)
 SciPy is an open source library of scientific tools for Python. It provides
 functions for mathematics, science, and engineering. It is built on top of
 NumPy.
 Built with the gnu15 compiler family and openmpi5 MPI stack.
 .
 This package is part of the OpenHPC project.
